## Interface: 16001, 120105
## Title: Data: Auction Scans
## Notes: Every full scan of the auction house, every auction in it, in a file of its own. Sane UI loads it when you open the auction house, so a login never has to read it. Switched off, the scans' prices are still kept, but not each auction.
